List and resolve deterministic query playbooks

Usage:
  eshu playbooks [command]

Available Commands:
  list        List query playbooks
  resolve     Resolve a query playbook into bounded calls

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for playbooks

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization

Use "eshu playbooks [command] --help" for more information about a command.
